sequenceDiagram
  participant S as MCP server
  participant H as Host / client
  participant M as Model
  H->>S: tools/list
  S-->>H: Provider tool definitions
  H->>M: Deferred names and task context
  M->>H: ToolSearch selects search + fetch
  H-->>M: Selected definitions
  Note over S,M: Two layers: provider discovery and model-context loading
  Note over S,M: ToolSearch is a host facility, not an MCP method
